# Add reviewed entries to the existing Mole whitelist; never replace that file.
# Render USER_HOME to an absolute path first. Keep existing custom protections.
# These are generic preservation examples, not a copy of a personal whitelist.
# Whole IDE roots intentionally also preserve rebuildable indexes/caches.
